    <p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#A3A39F">Your monthly report is generated on the 1st of each month.<br>WaiseKa · waiseka.app</p>
  </td></tr>
  </table>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>"
